OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMerseyrail boss defends e-bikes
OL,4,Aban
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors in Liverpool have claimed
OL,7,Fthe changes were made without
OL,8,Fconsulting local active travel or
OL,9,Fdisability groups.
OL,11,FBut Suzanne Grant said the decision
OL,12,F"wasn't taken lightly" and the ban was
OL,13,Fessential to protect staff and
OL,14,Fpassengers.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
